From: sergej19882906 <sergej19882906@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 23:27:35 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] pejir-idata: restore stock Wi-Fi/passwords from idata
 partition

Vendor idata_load/flash/getconf (standalone, libc only) import the
factory idata NAND partition into UCI as idata.device.*. uci-defaults
maps it at first boot: stock Wi-Fi SSID/keys/country -> wireless,
admin_pass -> root password, wps_pin stored on radios.
